# Format:
# CN|FQDN|SAN_LIST|EXTENSIONS_LIST
#
# Field Definitions:
# 1. CN: Common Name (used for folder naming and file outputs)
# 2. FQDN: Fully Qualified Domain Name (primary Subject DN CN)
# 3. SAN_LIST: Comma-separated list of DNS names (DNS:) or IP addresses (IP:)
# 4. EXTENSIONS_LIST: Comma-separated OpenSSL ExtendedKeyUsage (e.g., serverAuth, clientAuth)
#web-server-01|web01.example.com|DNS:web01.example.com,DNS:www.example.com,IP:192.168.10.50|serverAuth
#app-node-02|app02.example.com|DNS:app02.example.com,DNS:app-internal.example.com,IP:10.0.0.12|serverAuth,clientAuth
#db-cluster-01|db01.example.com|DNS:db01.example.com,IP:10.0.0.20,IP:10.0.0.21|serverAuth
